sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as User (Browser)
    participant FE as Next.js (:3000)
    participant BE as Spring Boot (:8080)
    participant Google as Google OAuth

    User->>FE: Click "Continue with Google"
    FE->>BE: GET /api/v1/auth/oidc/login?provider=google
    BE->>BE: Generate state, store in stateStore
    BE-->>FE: 302 Redirect → Google OAuth URL

    FE->>Google: Redirect to consent screen
    User->>Google: Approve
    Google-->>BE: 302 → /oidc/callback?code=...&state=...

    BE->>BE: Validate state (CSRF)
    BE->>Google: POST /oauth2/token (exchange code)
    Google-->>BE: { id_token, access_token }
    BE->>BE: Decode ID token → email, name, sub

    alt Identity already linked
        BE->>BE: Find user_identities by provider+sub
    else Same email exists
        BE->>BE: Link identity to existing user
    else New user
        BE->>BE: Create user (verified=true, BUYER)
    end

    BE->>BE: Generate JWT pair, store in oneTimeCodes (60s)
    BE-->>FE: 302 → /auth/callback?code=<one-time-code>

    FE->>BE: POST /api/auth/oidc/token { code }
    BE->>BE: Validate code, remove from map
    BE-->>FE: { accessToken, refreshToken, user }

    FE->>FE: Set httpOnly cookies, setUser()
    FE-->>User: Redirect to / (logged in)
